<InfoPage title="About Metadata Remover" description="Learn how Metadata Remover helps people inspect and remove metadata from supported photos, images, and PDF files in their browser.">
  <p>Metadata Remover is a privacy-first utility for inspecting and cleaning supported JPG, PNG, WebP, and PDF files before you share them.</p>
  <section><h2>Our approach</h2><p>Your files are processed in your browser. We do not upload them to a Metadata Remover server, and the original file stays on your device. The tool creates a separate cleaned copy for you to review and download.</p></section>
  <section><h2>What the tool does</h2><p>It identifies readable metadata such as GPS, camera, creator, device, date, and PDF document properties. You can then choose an available cleanup mode and verify the resulting file before sharing it.</p></section>
  <section><h2>Supported formats</h2><p>Version 1 supports JPG, PNG, WebP, and PDF files. We show only cleanup options that are appropriate for the detected file and metadata.</p></section>
  <section><h2>Contact</h2><p>For questions about the service, email <a href="mailto:support@metadataremovertool.com">support@metadataremovertool.com</a>.</p></section>
</InfoPage>
